flowchart LR
  A["Push or<br/>pull request"] --> B["checkout<br/>and set up Python"]
  B --> C["gitleaks<br/>secret scan"]
  C --> D["yamllint<br/>rule, hunt, playbook<br/>and workflow YAML"]
  D --> E["ci_validate.py<br/>schema · ATT&amp;CK · telemetry · entities<br/>alert details · metadata bar · KQL lint<br/>validation ledger"]
  E --> F["pytest<br/>rules · ledger · deployment templates<br/>backtests · image evidence · diagrams<br/>documented numbers · negative tests<br/>Sigma converter · toolchain"]
  F --> G["check_links.py<br/>relative links in docs"]
  G --> H["six drift gates —<br/>regenerate and compare,<br/>fail on disagreement:<br/>coverage.md + layer.json<br/>tests/atomics.md · deploy/<br/>metrics-matrix.md<br/>workbook preview · charts"]
  H --> J["package_rules.py<br/>metadata-stripped YAML,<br/>uploaded as the build artefact"]
